    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A cinematic journey of magic, mystery, and myth</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long ago, the Land of the Gods floated high above the skies\u2014powered by ancient crystals and protected by peaceful divine spirits. But everything changed when a mysterious beautiful witch appeared, driven by a dark force known as the Mystical Cloning Powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeated and cast down to Earth, you awaken with only fragments of your memory, yet she somehow knows who you are. Now, with the balance of the skies in danger, you must reclaim the crystals, uncover the truth behind the witch\u2019s betrayal, and restore the floating world.</p>",
